# age recipients — one public key per line, comments allowed.
# Every operator key listed here can decrypt all *.env.age files in this directory.
#
# Add a key:
#   age-keygen -y ~/.config/age/operator.key   # prints the public key
# then append it below with a comment line above.
#
# Remove a key: delete the line, then re-encrypt every .env.age (see secrets/README.md).

# --- operators ---
# add yours here, format:
# # <name> — <machine> @ <YYYY-MM-DD>
# age1...

# Dylan — laptop @ 2026-05-19
